   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi All,</div><div><br></div><div>I was wondering whether I can select a different local snapshot directory other than the default <span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\">~/.checkpoint/.</span></div><div><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\">I find the ~/.checkpoint/DATE structure to be very useful mainly because it avoids creating a package directory for every project. BUT pointing to a different path other than the default one </font></span><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\">is useful for a variety of reasons. In my case I&#39;m using R from a portable USB pendrive but <span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\">~/.<font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"> is poiting to the usual Document folder in the local C drive which is creating duplicates when I plug my pen into different computers rather than having a unique ~/.checkpoint/DATE directory on my portable pen.</font></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><br></font></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\">Thanks for any hints,</font></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\">Paolo</font></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;border-collapse:separate;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal monospace;col