     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Josée,<div><br></div><div>thanks for your response.</div><div>Unfortunately your link is referring to changing the default snapshot DATE rather than the default snapshot FOLDER.</div><div>The default behaviour is to have all the packages being installed in their relevant snapshot under the ~/.checkpoint/ folder...I need to have them into another folder/path. I hope it make it clearer.</div></div>"
    ],
